{"about_the_game":"In Biomeinoes, you place randomly drawn domino tiles one by one on a grid \u2014 you only have a handful of tiles, and the game ends when you run out.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672880/extras/desc2.png?t=1709305212\" /><br>When connected, the edges of these tiles form regions of the game's biomes in the isometric plane:<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672880/extras/desc1.png?t=1709305212\" /><br>If you finish such a region of one biome (larger than 1x1), you earn 1 bonus tile for every unit of area it contains. You can also build up huge scores by completing larger and larger areas!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672880/extras/desc3.png?t=1709305212\" /><br>For most biomes, completing 4 whole regions unlocks another biome.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every playthrough is different<br></li><li> Enormous skill ceiling<br></li><li> 2530 tiles to discover and collect<br></li><li> 48 Steam achievements<br></li><li> Time trials<br></li><li> Daily challenges<br></li><li> Unlockable extras<br></li><li> Global Steam leaderboards for every game mode<br></li><li> Over an hour of beautiful, uniquely relaxing original music by Mark Bondar<br></li><li> Robust rank system to record and compare skill levels, from beginner to grandmaster<br></li><li> Steam cloud support<br></li><li> Multiple save slots</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Great Oak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/3464143487c883f8ec79006637a5c95f9594881d.jpg"},{"name":"Windmill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/8d1dee95ec25a8b159e39f1e7fe03d24527207f8.jpg"},{"name":"Lighthouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/203c9de14f794933e44a6b57cefe4612b025066f.jpg"},{"name":"Pyramid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/f092caf4822b967db1714a7627241496c946d58f.jpg"},{"name":"Town Hall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/acd38eae3f9bf3fc7edd682060036022099c4d51.jpg"},{"name":"Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/c9fac415b8ed29798bd4eb5793dbaaade70c66b8.jpg"},{"name":"Volcano","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/2d291cceac636726a56c714f80753921f5cdebad.jpg"},{"name":"Camp Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/c08e4e4e98229539bcda3adc003f55817f141ebf.jpg"},{"name":"Geode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/47d81d2bf71813fde19321f33edbbde4c4de490c.jpg"},{"name":"Monumental","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2672880/e84f3dd2ac1273dcb293d8bd9af9d1c57c394e5a.jpg"}],"total":48},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2672880?t=1709305212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1709305212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1709305212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1709305212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"In Biomeinoes, you place randomly drawn domino tiles one by one on a grid \u2014 you only have a h